luding Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Gemini - essential cost monitoring for AI development workflows.\n   399→                    </div>\n   400→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   401→                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n   402→                        <span>📅 2026-07-28</span>\n   403→                        <span><a href=\"https://github.com/getagentseal/codeburn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n   404→                    </div>\n   405→                </div>\n   406→\n   407→                <div class=\"item\">\n   408→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   409→                        <a href=\"https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">rtk</a>\n   410→                    </div>\n   411→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   412→                        CLI proxy that reduces LLM token consumption by 60-90% on common dev commands - addresses the critical cost optimization need in AI coding workflows.\n   413→                    </div>\n   414→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   415→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n   416→                        <span>📅 2026-07-28</span>\n   417→                        <span><a href=\"https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n   418→                    </div>\n   419→                </div>\n   420→\n   421→                <div class=\"item\">\n   422→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   423→                        <a href=\"https://github.com/yvgude/lean-ctx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lean-ctx</a>\n   424→                    </div>\n   425→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   426→                        Context intelligence layer deciding what agents read and remember with 60-90% fewer tokens - solves the context window problem efficiently for AI coding agents.\n   427→         