ction and security analysis.\n   833→                    </div>\n   834→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   835→                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n   836→                        <span>📅 2026-07-20</span>\n   837→                        <span><a href=\"https://github.com/Kritt-ai/open-kritt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n   838→                    </div>\n   839→                </div>\n   840→\n   841→                <div class=\"item\">\n   842→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   843→                        <a href=\"https://github.com/ElarineNycanis/Citizen-Agent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Citizen-Agent</a>\n   844→                    </div>\n   845→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   846→                        Open-source AI terminal assistant with dynamic model switching, built-in vision understanding, AI image generation, music playback, and 5 parallel sub-agents.\n   847→                    </div>\n   848→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   849→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n   850→                        <span>📅 2026-07-17</span>\n   851→                        <span><a href=\"https://github.com/ElarineNycanis/Citizen-Agent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n   852→                    </div>\n   853→                </div>\n   854→\n   855→                <div class=\"item\">\n   856→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   857→                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/unabyss-for-claude\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Unabyss for Claude</a>\n   858→                    </div>\n   859→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   860→                        A shared memory layer and workspace memory tool for Claude that creates unified context across all applications and LLMs. Pulls context from 20+ apps including email, Google Drive, GitHub, Notion, and meeting recorders.\n   861→                    </div>\n   862→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   863→                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n   864→                        <span>📅 2026-07-17</span>\n   865→                        <span><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/unabyss-for-claude\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 Product Hunt</a></span>\n   866→                    </div>\n   867→                </div>\n   868→\n   869→                <div class=\"item\">\n   870→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   871→                        <a href=\"https://github.com/KlaatAI/klaatcode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KlaatCode</a>\n   872→                    </div>\n   873→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   874→                        Open-source AI coding agent for the terminal with Claude Code-grade accuracy and smart model routing. Uses the right AI model for each task, cutting costs 10x. Supports Claude, GPT, Gemini, DeepSeek & more.\n   875→                    </div>\n   876→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   877→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n   878→                        <span>📅 2026-07-17</span>\n   879→                        <span><a href=\"https://github.com/KlaatAI/klaatcode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n   880→                    </div>\n   881→                </div>\n   882→            </section>\n   883→\n   884→            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section (35%) -->\n   885→            <section class=\"whitelist-updates section\" id=\"whitelist-updates\">\n   886→                <h2 class=\"section-header\">\n   887→                    Whitelist Updates\n   888→                    <span class=\"count\">10 items</span>\n   889→                </h2>\n   890→\n   891→                <div class=\"item\">\n   892→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\