elog</a></span>\n   952→                    </div>\n   953→                </div>\n   954→\n   955→                <div class=\"item\">\n   956→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   957→                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n   958→                            Cursor: Cursor Start\n   959→                        </a>\n   960→                    </div>\n   961→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   962→                        New feature called Cursor Start was announced, improving onboarding and setup experience for new users.\n   963→                    </div>\n   964→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   965→                        <span class=\"tag feature\">Feature</span>\n   966→                        <span>📅 2026-07-28</span>\n   967→                        <span><a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Changelog</a></span>\n   968→                    </div>\n   969→                </div>\n   970→\n   971→                <div class=\"item\">\n   972→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   973→                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n   974→                            Codex CLI: Desktop App Version 26.715\n   975→                        </a>\n   976→                    </div>\n   977→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   978→                        ChatGPT Voice powered by GPT-Live, multi-folder local projects support, and screen context sharing on macOS.\n   979→                    </div>\n   980→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   981→                        <span class=\"tag release\">Release</span>\n   982→                        <span>📅 2026-07-23</span>\n   983→                        <span><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Changelog</a></span>\