esk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/Elysium-Labs-EU/argus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">argus</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Deterministic supervisor for multi-agent AI coding workflows: spawns workers, verifies diffs against git (not self-reports), and ships PRs with safety guarantees.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-19</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://github.com/Elysium-Labs-EU/argus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/buhuipao/agent-console\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">agent-console</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        A local terminal control plane for Codex and Claude Code sessions - discover, monitor, resume, and work beside persistent workspace shells.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-18</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://github.com/buhuipao/agent-console\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/aovestdipaperino/plank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">plank</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Interactive terminal coding agent in Rust - runs the DeepSeek V4 Flash model locally on macOS (Metal), with a Ratatui TUI, full tool suite, MCP, and persistent sessions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-18</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://github.com/aovestdipaperino/plank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/clark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clark</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        An AI agent with its own private cloud computer that can browse the web, run code, manage files, and return finished artifacts. Unlike typical AI assistants that only provide advice, Clark has a dedicated browser, terminal, and file system.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-18</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/clark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 Product Hunt</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/zoodata\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ZooData</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        The data layer for AI agents that transforms any URL into agent-ready JSON, enabling AI agents to work with structured data instead of raw HTML or bloated markdown. Ranked #1 on Product Hunt for July 18, 2026 with 630 upvotes.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-18</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/zoodata\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 Product Hunt</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/openmarkdown\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenMarkdown</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        A fast, lightweight markdown editor designed for collaborative editing between developers and AI agents. Opens any .md file instantly and enables real-time co-editing where the AI agent can read, write, and format markdown alongside the user.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI IDE</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-18</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/openmarkdown\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 Product Hunt</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/Kritt-ai/open-kritt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kritt</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Orchestrate AI agents to find real vulnerabilities in code - security-focused AI agent for automated vulnerability detection and security analysis.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-20</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://github.com/Kritt-ai/open-kritt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/ElarineNycanis/Citizen-Agent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Citizen-Agent</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Open-source AI terminal assistant with dynamic model switching, built-in vision understanding, AI image generation, music playback, and 5 parallel sub-agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-17</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://github.com/ElarineNycanis/Citizen-Agent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/unabyss-for-claude\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Unabyss for Claude</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        A shared memory layer and workspace memory tool for Claude that creates unified context across all applications and LLMs. Pulls context from 20+ apps including email, Google Drive, GitHub, Notion, and meeting recorders.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-17</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/unabyss-for-claude\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 Product Hunt</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/KlaatAI/klaatcode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KlaatCode</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Open-source AI coding agent for the terminal with Claude Code-grade accuracy and smart model routing. Uses the right AI model for each task, cutting costs 10x. Supports Claude, GPT, Gemini, DeepSeek & more.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-17</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://github.com/KlaatAI/klaatcode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">🔗 GitHub</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section (35%) -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates section\" id=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-header\">\n                    Whitelist Updates\n                    <span class=\"count\">10 items</span>\n                </h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Codex CLI: Desktop App Version 26.727\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Enhanced browser with address bar history search, multi-repository code review across folders, expanded image editing with Canvas/Focused views, and new Activity view sidebar.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-30</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Changelog</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Cursor: Cursor on iPad\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Cursor launched its iPad app, bringing the AI-powered code editor to Apple's tablet platform.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-29</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Changelog</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Codex CLI 0.146.0\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added session naming with /new and /clear commands, thread pinning, Amazon Bedrock and Claude Code marketplace support, WebSocket support for remote code-mode hosts, and paginated thread history.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-29</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Changelog</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Gemini CLI v0.53.0\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Implemented LLM triage orchestration and container build setup, added evaluation coverage reporting, enhanced security with workspace trust enforcement and infinite loop mitigations.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-28</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Changelog</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Cursor: Cursor Start\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New feature called Cursor Start was announced, improving onboarding and setup experience for new users.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-28</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Changelog</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Codex CLI: Desktop App Version 26.715\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        ChatGPT Voice powered by GPT-Live, multi-folder local projects support, and screen context sharing on macOS.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-23</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Changelog</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Gemini CLI v0.52.0\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Built core triage worker modules and execution loops, improved file handling for JSON and IPYNB files, updated authentication libraries and added clearer error messaging.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-22</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Changelog</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Cursor: Cursor Router\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Cursor Router feature was released, enhancing routing capabilities within the IDE.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-22</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Changelog</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Codex CLI 0.145.0\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Stabilized multi-agent V2 with configurable sub-agents, added experimental paginated thread history, import for Cursor and Claude Code settings, Amazon Bedrock login with GPT-5.6 Sol, and streaming realtime V3 conversations.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-21</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Changelog</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Cursor: Agent Swarms and Model Economics\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Published research on agent swarms and new model economics, exploring the future of AI-powered development workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag announcement\">Announcement</span>\n                        <span>📅 2026-07-20</span>\n                        <span><a href=\"https://cursor.com/blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📄 Blog</a></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section (25%) -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights section\" id=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-header\">\n                    Technical Insights\n                    <span class=\"count\">0 items</span>\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"empty-state\">\n                    <div class=\"empty-state-icon\">💡</div>\n                    <p>No technical insights captured in the last 7 days from thought leaders and industry sources.</p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-content\">\n                <a href=\"#about\">About This Report</a>\n                <a href=\"#methodology\">Methodology</a>\n                <a href=\"#sources\">Data Sources</a>\n                <span>|</span>\n                <span>Generated: 2026-07-31</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n                <p>Report generated by <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/agent-daily\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Agent Code Daily</a> - Powered by <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/agent-sdk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Agent SDK</a></p>\n      